// "If you would flip a coin, instead flip two coins and ignore one." A
// ROLL-MORE replacement ([CR#614.3] Krark's Thumb-family; [CR#706.6] the
// ignore-result semantics) — exercises `StaticEffect::ReplaceRoll` (new) and
// `IgnoreRule::IgnoreChosen` (new): the flipper picks which of the two
// results to disregard ([CR#706.6] — not an automatic lowest-value rule, so
// `IgnoreChosen(1)`, not `IgnoreLowest`).
Normal(
  name: "Krark's Thumb",
  mana_cost: [
    Generic(2),
  ],
  supertypes: [
    Legendary,
  ],
  types: [
    Artifact,
  ],
  abilities: [
    Static(ReplaceRoll(query: CoinFlipped(by: Ref(You)), extra: 1, ignore: IgnoreChosen(1))),
  ],
)
